        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 12
      },
      {
        "text": "And David said unto Nathan, I have sinned against the Lord. And Nathan said unto David, The Lord also hath put away thy sin; thou shalt not die.",
        "footNotes": [
          {
            "start": 35,
            "end": 41,
            "text": "Gen. 39:9; 1 Sam. 15:24; Ps. 51:4. TG Sin."
          },
          {
            "start": 102,
            "end": 115,
            "text": "HEB hath caused to pass; i.e., he was not punished immediately by death; but he did not escape punishment. See D&C 132:39. JST 2 Sam. 12:13 … hath not put away thy sin that thou shalt not die. 2 Ne. 9:35."
          }
        ],
        "italics": [],
        "associatedContent": [],
        "verseNumber": 13,
        "crossReferences": [],
        "jstReferences": [],
        "reference": "2 Samuel 12:13",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 13
      },
      {
