        "reference": "2 Samuel 12:14",
        "book": "2 Samuel",
        "chapter": 12,
        "verse": 14
      },
      {
        "text": "And Nathan departed unto his house. And the Lord struck the child that Uriah’s wife bare unto David, and it was very sick.",
